==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
Short form of {{l|en|Christina}} or of any female name ending in ''-tina'', such as {{l|en|Martina}} or {{l|en|Albertina}}; frequently from {{der|en|la|-ina}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈtiːnə/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|~}}

# {{given name|en|female}}.
## {{given name|en|female|from=Ancient Greek}}.
## {{given name|en|female|from=Latin}}.
